If this is really what's going on, I would suggest a change.
Semantics like that will cause too much confusion.
Why not just let pickup_types be "all" by default, rather than
setting pickup_types implicitly when autopickup is set?
It seems to me this would still provide full backward compatibility
(to when pickup_types did not exist).

Hoping that the above is not really the case,

